# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Gadgetzan

step Back from Mount Hyjal
  when zone "Winterspring"
  when taxi "Gadgetzan"
  tip Back from Mount Hyjal: fly from Everlook to Gadgetzan for Gaeriyan, Sprinkle and Pestlezugg, then on to Marshal's Refuge and Silithus.
  zone Winterspring
  goto 60.43,36.36 "Yugrek, the Horde flight master" live
  fly "Gadgetzan"
  zone Tanaris

step Gaeriyan
  when onquest 3912
  tip Drink the Videre Elixir at the graveyard just east of Gadgetzan: it kills you, and only as a ghost can you see Gaeriyan, in a rocky crevice in the hills due north of it. Talk to him there, then run back to your body and resurrect: the Conspicuous Gravestone he sends you to stands in that graveyard.
  use 11243 @54.0,28.7 map 1446         -- Videre Elixir
  turnin 3912
  accept 3913

step Sprinkle
  tip Use Umi's Mechanical Yeti on Sprinkle, the goblin girl in Gadgetzan. Quixxil and Legacki are scared later in the route.
  kill 7583 quest 5163.2 "Scare Sprinkle with Umi's Mechanical Yeti"
  use 12928 quest 5163.2 @51.1,26.9 map 1446

step Alchemist Pestlezugg
